TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T0Intro::
    .string "The EMBER hall is closed to\n"
    .string "strangers.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T0Defeat::
    .string "Burnt out...$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T0Post::
    .string "Deeper in, the heat is worse.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T1Intro::
    .string "Our flame never dies, and neither\n"
    .string "do we!$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T1Defeat::
    .string "The flame flickers.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T1Post::
    .string "The ORACLE keeps the last room.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T2Intro::
    .string "The beast gave us warmth when\n"
    .string "the sky turned cold.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T2Defeat::
    .string "Warmth fades...$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T2Post::
    .string "Mind the lava. It is hungry.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T3Intro::
    .string "You smell of rain. Leave, or\n"
    .string "burn!$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T3Defeat::
    .string "Only ash remains.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T3Post::
    .string "The ORACLE is waiting.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T4Intro::
    .string "I am the ORACLE of the EMBER.\n"
    .string "The beast sleeps in my care.\p"
    .string "Prove that your fire is worth\n"
    .string "more than my fear.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T4Defeat::
    .string "...Then the flame has chosen you.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_T4Post::
    .string "Go. Keep it burning.$"

TwoIsland_CapeBrink_EmberDen_Text_GuardsLeft::
    .string "The beast does not stir.\n"
    .string "Its guardians still stand watch.$"
